Source: pg-vault-tde
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libssl-dev (>= 3.0), libcurl4-openssl-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/labmiriade/pg_vault_tde

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-vault-tde
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-vault-tde
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Transparent Data Encryption for PostgreSQL
 pg_vault_tde encrypts table and index data at rest through custom access
 methods and supports Vault, OpenBao, local wallets, and PKCS#11 key providers.
 The module must be configured in shared_preload_libraries before use.
